  displayName: Fist of Mars
  role: 3
  description: 'A Sagittarius main battle tank crewed by the ISF''s finest tank aces,
    the red Symbol of Mars painted on both sides of its turret. It has the Sagittarius''
    20 health and Armor Level 4, its 100mm Cannon (10 damage, penetration 4, 50 m,
    once a turn) and a Frag Grenade thrown up to 50 m every turn, but aims at 125%:
    it never misses, and has a 25% chance to crit. It moves 30 m but, being Mechanical,
    can''t sprint, and when destroyed it has a 10% chance to explode (Unstable).
    Large: friendly Biological soldiers within 5 m can shelter behind it (half-cover).
    Unique: only one per army. A Specialist.'
